# Not needed for local development - Vite's dev server proxies /api/**
# straight to the Spring Boot backend (see vite.config.js), so relative
# fetch('/api/...') calls just work.
#
# Only set this for a production build served from its own domain
# (no dev proxy involved), pointing at wherever the backend is deployed:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.hemoconnect.example.com
